# Rename this file to CNAME (no extension) and put a single line in it
# containing your custom domain, with no protocol and no trailing slash:
#
#     rakeshnaik.com
#
# Then add these DNS records at your registrar:
#
#   A     @   185.199.108.153
#   A     @   185.199.109.153
#   A     @   185.199.110.153
#   A     @   185.199.111.153
#   CNAME www rakeshnaik.github.io
#
# Finally, tick "Enforce HTTPS" in Settings -> Pages.
# Remember to update the canonical URLs and sitemap.xml to the new domain.
